 "description": "Brand New\nBe the first person to live in this exceptional two bedroom, two bathroom apartment in the brand new One Clapham development.\n\nEverything here is completely new and the finish is superb throughout, with a beautifully designed kitchen, high-quality bathrooms, underfloor heating and a bright, carefully finished interior. The apartment is offered fully furnished and is ready to move straight into.\n\nThe View\nThe real showstopper is the view. The living space opens directly onto a private balcony with incredible far-reaching views across London – a genuinely impressive backdrop both during the day and at night.\n\nThe Apartment\nThere are two double bedrooms, two bathrooms including an en-suite to the principal bedroom, and an excellent open-plan kitchen, dining and living space.\n\nThe Development: One Clapham\nResidents have access to a 24-hour concierge, Peloton Hub and landscaped communal spaces.\n\nThe Location\nClapham Junction is moments away, with St John's Hill, Northcote Road and Battersea Rise all close by. Locally you've got The Northcote, Vagabond Wines, Northcote Records and The Ivy Northcote Road, alongside independent coffee shops, delis and boutiques.\n\nNorthcote Road Market is also nearby, while Wandsworth Common, Clapham Common and Battersea Park are all within easy reach.\n\nFurnished & Available Immediately\n\nCall Using Ref JB0670 for More Info and To View",
